    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d271">

                <pb facs="0925" n="901" sameAs="frus:frus1946v02/pg901"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">C.F.M. Files: Lot M–88: Box 2061: CFM
                    Documents</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Draft Resolution by the French Delegation to the
                        Council of Foreign Ministers</hi><anchor n="29" xml:id="d271-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/> C.F.M.(46) 226</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-07-11">11 July, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Germany</hi></p>
                <p>The Council of Foreign Ministers hereby decides to instruct the Allied Control
                    Council <hi rendition="#italic">to appoint a Committee of qualified experts</hi>
                    <pb facs="0926" n="902" xml:id="pg902"/> which shall report to the four
                    Governments by 10th August, 1946 at the latest on the following points: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Steps to be taken to increase the German output of coal;</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>General principles which should govern the apportionment of the German
                            output as between domestic consumption and exports.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>The Committee’s report will be discussed by the Council of Foreign Ministers
                    before 1st September, 1946.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d271-f1" n="29" type="source" xml:id="d271-f1-content">
                <p>This resolution was discussed by the Council of Foreign Ministers at its 41st
                    Meeting, July 12, 1946, and was amended and approved by the Council at its 42nd
                    Meeting, July 12. For the agreed amendment, see the Record of Decisions of the
                    42nd Meeting, <ref target="#pg937">p. 937</ref>; see also the United States
                    Delegation Records of the 41st and 42nd Meetings, <ref target="#pg907">pp.
                        907</ref> and <ref target="#pg918">918</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
